    {
        "content": "<p>You will probably find it difficult to find reviewers in this area (people interested in foundations are thin on the ground amongst the maintainers), so getting this material into mathlib will likely be a frustrating experience for you. I would suggest making your own repo relying on mathlib as a dependency (or not even relying on mathlib at all if you don't need it).</p>",
        "id": 611632121,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1784542246
